WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:30,160
Alih Bahasa oleh KehidupFun

2
00:00:30,184 --> 00:00:45,184
Dilarang menghapus Credit.

3
00:01:49,340 --> 00:01:51,308
Julia, Aku sudah siap.

4
00:02:06,824 --> 00:02:12,222
ARKTIK. DEKAT KUTUB UTARA

5
00:02:25,260 --> 00:02:28,800
Halo, halo, Julia!

6
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,420
Kau bisa mendengarku?

7
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:32,500
Kami meledakkan muatan ganda.

8
00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:34,800
Merekam hasilnya.
Kami akan segera mengulanginya.

9
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:37,960
Hentikan semua pekerjaan sekarang juga!
Badai akan datang!

10
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:39,620
Kembali ke kamp utama!

11
00:02:39,700 --> 00:02:42,990
Sekarang juga! Kau mendengarku? Julia!

12
00:02:43,608 --> 00:02:45,278
Oskar!

13
00:03:17,820 --> 00:03:19,861
Para ahli geologi itu meledakkan sesuatu lagi.

14
00:03:20,061 --> 00:03:21,868
Tak bisa tenang.

15
00:03:22,260 --> 00:03:24,810
Semua satwa liar jadi pergi ketakutan.

16
00:03:24,890 --> 00:03:27,728
Perhatian! Komandan di anjungan!

17
00:03:33,181 --> 00:03:35,770
Komandan, Kapal Selam Ataman Ermak...

18
00:03:35,842 --> 00:03:38,821
...di perairan netral, di area patroli rahasia...

19
00:03:38,892 --> 00:03:41,410
...hari ke-83 dalam pelayaran mandiri.

20
00:03:41,490 --> 00:03:45,100
Haluan 38 derajat, kedalaman 300.

21
00:03:45,180 --> 00:03:46,642
Cakrawala akustik bersih.

22
00:03:46,724 --> 00:03:48,264
Navigator, jarak kapal dengan dasar laut?

23
00:03:48,613 --> 00:03:50,790
- 2000, Komandan.
- Jarak ke pangkalan?

24
00:03:50,854 --> 00:03:51,884
550 mil.

25
00:03:52,035 --> 00:03:53,135
Palych.

26
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,190
Lihat ini.

27
00:04:03,178 --> 00:04:04,758
Apa itu, Karpenko?

28
00:04:06,510 --> 00:04:08,750
Ada suara bising berintensitas tinggi di depan.

29
00:04:09,173 --> 00:04:10,393
Komandan!

30
00:04:12,584 --> 00:04:14,024
Dasar lautnya naik.

31
00:04:55,035 --> 00:04:57,137
Lari! Lebih cepat!

32
00:04:58,332 --> 00:04:59,957
Lari! Julia!

33
00:05:00,126 --> 00:05:04,159
Pergi! Tinggalkan semuanya! Lari!

34
00:05:04,216 --> 00:05:05,481
Tidak, tunggu!

35
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:07,590
Ayo, nyalakan!

36
00:05:13,077 --> 00:05:14,637
Sonar, klasifikasikan kontak!

37
00:05:14,662 --> 00:05:16,752
Siap, mengklasifikasikan kontak!

38
00:05:17,003 --> 00:05:18,593
Konfirmasi haluan 270!

39
00:05:18,759 --> 00:05:20,606
Terdeteksi suara bising biologis berdaya tinggi!

40
00:05:20,631 --> 00:05:21,844
Disarankan mengukur jarak!

41
00:05:21,868 --> 00:05:23,614
Siapkan sonar aktif.

42
00:05:24,201 --> 00:05:25,997
- Siap.
- Kirim satu ping.

43
00:05:26,022 --> 00:05:27,473
Jarak 15 kabel.

44
00:05:28,516 --> 00:05:29,816
Jarak semakin dekat.

45
00:05:29,865 --> 00:05:31,590
Belok tajam ke kiri!
Turbin maju 100!

46
00:05:31,615 --> 00:05:32,671
Siap!

47
00:05:32,696 --> 00:05:34,934
Siaga tempur! Manuver penghindaran!

48
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:37,860
Pos tempur! Manuver...

49
00:05:55,764 --> 00:05:57,744
Kamp kita!

50
00:06:01,585 --> 00:06:03,515
Pegang erat!

51
00:06:36,450 --> 00:06:39,780
Torpedo satu dan dua siaga.

52
00:06:40,187 --> 00:06:43,517
- 420, kita tenggelam!
- Kapten, Aku tidak dapat menentukan...

53
00:06:43,542 --> 00:06:45,916
Muncul ke permukaan! Turbin maju!

54
00:06:45,991 --> 00:06:48,221
520! Kapal selam menukik!

55
00:06:55,303 --> 00:06:58,486
Hubungkan Udara Tekanan Tinggi Darurat!
Tiup ballast utama!

56
00:07:07,270 --> 00:07:09,210
Lepaskan pelampung darurat!

57
00:08:05,177 --> 00:08:10,395
St. Petersburg. Markas Besar Angkatan Laut Rusia.

58
00:08:20,563 --> 00:08:22,993
- Hening?
- Hening.

59
00:08:25,388 --> 00:08:26,988
Bagaimana ini bisa terjadi?

60
00:08:27,100 --> 00:08:29,356
Bagaimana kapal selam generasi terbaru
bisa menghilang?

61
00:08:29,381 --> 00:08:31,216
Panglima Tertinggi, Ataman Ermak...

62
00:08:31,241 --> 00:08:33,708
Aku tahu siapa yang berada di Ataman Ermak.

63
00:08:34,723 --> 00:08:35,763
Ada saran?

64
00:08:35,890 --> 00:08:38,490
Kami akan mengirim kapal selam khusus
untuk mencari.

65
00:08:40,412 --> 00:08:47,458
SEVEROMORSK, WILAYAH MURMANSK.

66
00:09:01,660 --> 00:09:04,706
Voronin yang lebih muda
baru saja mengambil komando di Arktik.

67
00:09:04,731 --> 00:09:07,060
- Panglima Tertinggi...
- Tepat, Arktik.

68
00:09:07,194 --> 00:09:08,194
Kirim dia.

69
00:09:08,227 --> 00:09:10,812
- Dia saudara komandan itu.
- Aku tahu.

70
00:09:11,128 --> 00:09:12,997
Itulah sebabnya kita mengirimnya.

71
00:09:14,071 --> 00:09:16,466
Apakah emosinya akan membantu...

72
00:09:17,619 --> 00:09:19,401
...atau justru menghambatnya,
kita tidak bisa menebak.

73
00:09:21,527 --> 00:09:25,777
Tunjuk Olshansky sebagai perwira senior
dengan wewenang penuh.

74
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:30,590
- Dia benar-benar pemburu tangguh.
- Lebih buruk lagi. Itu sebabnya Kau menunjuknya.

75
00:09:30,830 --> 00:09:32,998
Jika Voronin perlu dicopot dari tugas,...

76
00:09:33,099 --> 00:09:35,998
...dia akan mencopotnya
dan mengambil alih komando.

77
00:09:36,601 --> 00:09:37,601
Satu hal lagi.

78
00:09:40,311 --> 00:09:41,551
Jika terjadi...

79
00:09:42,513 --> 00:09:45,335
Jika kapal penjelajah strategis itu hilang...

80
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:49,820
...senjata rahasia di dalamnya
harus diamankan atau dihancurkan.

81
00:09:50,801 --> 00:09:53,151
Senjata itu tidak boleh jatuh
ke tangan yang salah.

82
00:09:53,224 --> 00:09:54,774
Dalam keadaan apa pun.

83
00:10:12,545 --> 00:10:14,145
Vitya, Aku tidak mengerti.

84
00:10:16,661 --> 00:10:17,851
Apakah sepenting itu?

85
00:10:18,130 --> 00:10:19,872
- Penting.
- Kau sedang cuti.

86
00:10:19,934 --> 00:10:23,630
- Tidak lagi.
- Paman Vitya, lihat, Aku menggambar burungmu.

87
00:10:23,710 --> 00:10:26,080
Bagus sekali. Kerja bagus.

88
00:10:28,587 --> 00:10:30,387
Nina Sergeevna, Aku harus pergi.

89
00:10:30,428 --> 00:10:32,608
Duduklah. Tinggallah sebentar lagi.

90
00:10:33,248 --> 00:10:34,758
Bagaimana keadaan kakakku?

91
00:10:35,311 --> 00:10:36,751
Sudah bulan ketiga di laut.

92
00:10:37,259 --> 00:10:38,409
Kami berangkat.

93
00:10:38,482 --> 00:10:39,592
Ibu.

94
00:10:41,582 --> 00:10:43,253
Aku sudah lama ingin bertanya.

95
00:10:43,941 --> 00:10:48,005
Mengapa Sasha selalu berpakaian pelaut
di foto-foto ini?

96
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:49,388
Selalu berseragam?

97
00:10:49,739 --> 00:10:51,410
Dan kenapa Aku hanya memakai pakaian sipil?

98
00:10:51,793 --> 00:10:52,793
Kenapa, Bu?

99
00:10:53,277 --> 00:10:57,724
Ibu menyukainya. Menurut ibu pakaian sipil
lebih cocok untukmu.

100
00:10:57,892 --> 00:11:00,672
Kau sebenarnya bisa menjadi dokter.
Tanganmu sangat terampil.

101
00:11:00,870 --> 00:11:03,347
Sudah waktunya Kau berdamai
dengan kakakmu.

102
00:11:03,518 --> 00:11:04,686
Bagaimana caranya?

103
00:11:04,758 --> 00:11:06,894
Entah dia yang berada di laut, atau Aku.

104
00:11:08,733 --> 00:11:10,409
Ini, Sasha lupa membawa ini.

105
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:11,980
Milik ayahmu.

106
00:11:13,430 --> 00:11:16,490
- Berikan kepadanya saat dia kembali.
- Itu membawa sial.

107
00:11:16,973 --> 00:11:18,783
Ayahmu tidak pernah pergi
dari rumah tanpa ini.

108
00:11:20,450 --> 00:11:22,370
Vit, hatiku tidak tenang.

109
00:11:24,407 --> 00:11:26,017
Tolong bawa ini.

110
00:11:43,803 --> 00:11:50,951
WILAYAH MURMANSK. SISI BARAT.

111
00:12:23,030 --> 00:12:24,250
Wakil Komandan.

112
00:12:24,330 --> 00:12:26,200
Komandan kapal Kapten Tingkat Dua Voronin.

113
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:27,800
Jangan berteriak, ini bukan inspeksi.

114
00:12:27,880 --> 00:12:29,080
Halo, Vitya.

115
00:12:29,900 --> 00:12:31,040
Halo, Paman Slav.

116
00:12:31,970 --> 00:12:34,115
Mengapa Kau belum naik ke kapal?

117
00:12:34,217 --> 00:12:36,717
Komandan dulu... tampaknya Kau belum tahu?

118
00:12:37,392 --> 00:12:38,582
Misi tempur.

119
00:12:40,818 --> 00:12:42,506
Buka perintah tersegel saat di laut.

120
00:12:43,456 --> 00:12:45,916
- Bawa ini ke kabinku.
- Baik, Komandan.

121
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:48,811
Bagaimana jika sesuatu yang serius terjadi di sana?

122
00:12:49,050 --> 00:12:50,483
Kau membawa burung itu bersamamu?

123
00:12:51,974 --> 00:12:54,674
Selamat datang di kapal, Laksamana Muda.

124
00:13:03,690 --> 00:13:04,860
Hormat!

125
00:13:07,936 --> 00:13:08,978
Istirahat di tempat!

126
00:13:09,003 --> 00:13:11,326
- Komandan, hormat.
- Hormat.

127
00:13:11,374 --> 00:13:13,912
Kapal selam sedang mempersiapkan operasi tempur,
penugasan, dan penyelaman.

128
00:13:14,006 --> 00:13:15,811
XO Kapten Tingkat Dua Tatarinov.

129
00:13:15,914 --> 00:13:18,314
- Halo.
- Halo, Vitya. Ada apa ini?

130
00:13:18,850 --> 00:13:20,880
Apakah dia datang untuk mengawasi
pelaksanaan tugas?

131
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:23,108
Orang tertua di kapal
sekaligus yang paling menakutkan?

132
00:13:23,633 --> 00:13:24,873
Kurang lebih begitu.

133
00:13:25,319 --> 00:13:27,030
Dia dulu XO di bawah ayahku.

134
00:13:27,910 --> 00:13:29,162
Teman keluarga. Lanjutkan tugas.

135
00:13:39,191 --> 00:13:41,881
- Hormat, Komandan.
- Hormat, Komandan.

136
00:13:41,906 --> 00:13:43,076
Hormat.

137
00:13:43,126 --> 00:13:44,553
Bagaimana? Kapal selam mini yang bagus.

138
00:13:44,940 --> 00:13:46,387
Kau belum pernah menaiki yang seperti ini.

139
00:13:48,310 --> 00:13:49,530
Aku pernah menaiki yang serupa.

140
00:13:49,610 --> 00:13:52,240
Ah, yang itu kecil. Yang ini bisa menyelam
sampai 1500 meter.

141
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:55,520
Ayo, turunkan saja, dia takut ketinggian.

142
00:13:55,710 --> 00:13:57,319
Ingin melihat bagian dalamnya?

143
00:13:57,449 --> 00:13:59,811
Di dalam sudah cukup sempit tanpaku.

144
00:14:00,076 --> 00:14:02,608
Mengapa Kau melamun, Karasik?
Siapa yang mengawasi?

145
00:14:02,633 --> 00:14:06,175
Navigator Bellingshausen? Ayo, ayo, turunkan...

146
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:08,764
Turunkan, turunkan, lebih berani, lebih berani.

147
00:14:09,459 --> 00:14:17,412
ARTIK

148
00:14:27,076 --> 00:14:30,453
- Perhatian. Komandan di Ruang Kendali.
- Istirahat di tempat.

149
00:14:30,508 --> 00:14:33,522
Reaktor nuklir, daya 20%, parameter normal.

150
00:14:33,547 --> 00:14:35,459
Sistem dan mekanisme berjalan dengan baik.

151
00:14:35,484 --> 00:14:37,414
Komandan, izin berbicara?

152
00:14:37,542 --> 00:14:39,686
Aku mengerti bahwa perintah
tidak untuk diperdebatkan.

153
00:14:39,782 --> 00:14:41,612
Tapi Aku benar-benar tidak sabar.

154
00:14:41,636 --> 00:14:42,865
Aku ditarik dari cuti.

155
00:14:42,890 --> 00:14:43,890
Perintah komando.

156
00:14:43,915 --> 00:14:45,342
- Tetapi pertanyaannya tetap ada.
- Tepat sekali.

157
00:14:45,367 --> 00:14:46,919
Kita akan tahu saat paket itu dibuka.

158
00:14:46,944 --> 00:14:48,025
Perhatian!

159
00:14:48,050 --> 00:14:49,842
Wakil Komandan di Ruang Kendali.

160
00:14:58,514 --> 00:14:59,754
Baiklah.

161
00:15:00,750 --> 00:15:02,100
Laporkan.

162
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:13,750
Lepaskan saja.

163
00:15:15,069 --> 00:15:16,560
Itu tidak berguna.

164
00:15:17,025 --> 00:15:21,335
Tidak ada seorang pun di sekitar sini
dalam ribuan mil.

165
00:15:23,843 --> 00:15:25,100
Sinyal.

166
00:15:25,549 --> 00:15:27,209
Ada sinyal!

167
00:15:27,321 --> 00:15:28,631
Julia!

168
00:15:30,606 --> 00:15:31,736
Hati-hati.

169
00:15:35,209 --> 00:15:37,103
- Oh tidak!
- Ya Tuhan!

170
00:15:37,316 --> 00:15:39,545
Di mana itu? Di mana?

171
00:15:39,570 --> 00:15:41,787
Di sini! Aku menangkap sinyalnya!

172
00:15:42,450 --> 00:15:43,772
Cepat hubungi!

173
00:15:48,436 --> 00:15:54,764
ANJUNGAN PENGEBORAN NORWEGIA

174
00:16:00,764 --> 00:16:01,783
Halo?

175
00:16:01,808 --> 00:16:05,120
Tolong! Tolong kami! Apakah Kau mendengarku?

176
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:08,050
- Kecilkan suaranya.
- Biar Aku saja.

177
00:16:08,075 --> 00:16:09,897
Ulangi, Aku tidak dapat mendengarmu.

178
00:16:09,957 --> 00:16:12,387
Sinyalnya lemah. Tetap di sana.
Hati-hati jangan sampai jatuh.

179
00:16:12,460 --> 00:16:13,608
Kami membutuhkan bantuan.

180
00:16:13,633 --> 00:16:16,580
Aku tidak bisa terhubung.
Grand-D ke titik. Mendesak.

181
00:16:16,660 --> 00:16:18,238
Dan matikan suara berisik itu!

182
00:16:18,277 --> 00:16:19,292
Halo.

183
00:16:19,655 --> 00:16:20,730
Sinyal.

184
00:16:20,755 --> 00:16:21,925
Sinyal hilang.

185
00:16:22,808 --> 00:16:23,808
Tidak!

186
00:16:27,541 --> 00:16:28,571
Halo.

187
00:16:28,660 --> 00:16:29,863
Halo? Kami membutuhkan bantuan.

188
00:16:30,687 --> 00:16:31,730
Halo.

189
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:34,870
Sial!

190
00:16:37,260 --> 00:16:38,322
Sinyal!

191
00:16:39,050 --> 00:16:40,081
Di mana?

192
00:17:04,792 --> 00:17:05,800
Oskar,...

193
00:17:06,023 --> 00:17:07,035
...bangun, kita pergi.

194
00:17:09,182 --> 00:17:10,601
Kita harus terus bergerak.

195
00:17:10,857 --> 00:17:12,703
Kita harus menemukan seseorang.

196
00:17:30,752 --> 00:17:33,349
Bosun, kanan 30, haluan 120,...

197
00:17:33,513 --> 00:17:35,356
...menuju pusat area penyelaman.

198
00:17:35,644 --> 00:17:37,481
Turbin maju 40.

199
00:17:44,980 --> 00:17:46,153
Ada apa, Vitya?

200
00:17:46,250 --> 00:17:47,582
Kau sudah menjadi Komandan,...

201
00:17:47,606 --> 00:17:49,570
...tapi kau senang seperti kadet?

202
00:17:56,300 --> 00:17:59,010
Saatnya turun, Laksamana Muda.

203
00:18:02,779 --> 00:18:04,755
Sepuluh kabel menuju titik penyelaman.

204
00:18:07,430 --> 00:18:09,330
Bersiap untuk menyelam.

205
00:18:11,505 --> 00:18:13,349
Pos penyelaman.

206
00:18:13,374 --> 00:18:16,704
Kru di pos penyelaman.
Personel lengkap.

207
00:18:26,465 --> 00:18:29,495
Haluan 358. Kecepatan 10 knot.

208
00:18:29,520 --> 00:18:31,570
Cakrawala akustik bersih.

209
00:18:37,737 --> 00:18:39,337
Siap menyelam.

210
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:46,200
Banjiri ballast utama.

211
00:18:50,252 --> 00:18:54,142
Bosun, menyelam ke lima puluh meter,
trim lima derajat menunduk di haluan.

212
00:18:54,222 --> 00:18:56,439
Kedalaman lima puluh meter.
Trim lima.

213
00:18:56,463 --> 00:18:58,022
Menyelam.

214
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:24,730
Bosun, pertahankan kedalaman 50.

215
00:19:24,810 --> 00:19:26,685
Kedalaman 50. Siap.

216
00:19:26,988 --> 00:19:29,578
Saatnya membuka perintah, Laksamana Muda.

217
00:19:32,388 --> 00:19:36,005
Ruang kendali, kadar hidrogen
di kompartemen 1,5%.

218
00:19:36,074 --> 00:19:38,692
Memohon izin mengaktifkan ventilasi.

219
00:19:56,070 --> 00:19:58,260
Apa itu? Ke mana mereka mengirim kita?

220
00:19:58,340 --> 00:19:59,570
Baca gerak bibirnya.

221
00:20:21,660 --> 00:20:23,650
Navigator, plot rutenya.

222
00:20:23,730 --> 00:20:25,128
Memetakan rute.

223
00:20:25,153 --> 00:20:27,354
Tingkatkan daya reaktor ke 50%.

224
00:20:27,379 --> 00:20:28,385
Siap.

225
00:20:28,665 --> 00:20:30,987
- Turbin maju 150.
- Siap, turbin 150.

226
00:20:31,012 --> 00:20:32,982
Belok kiri ke haluan 350.

227
00:20:34,875 --> 00:20:36,395
Menyalin koordinat.

228
00:20:38,682 --> 00:20:40,134
Sepertinya Ermak hilang.

229
00:20:40,159 --> 00:20:41,185
Apa?

230
00:20:41,310 --> 00:20:44,010
Yang penting jangan biarkan
emosi menguasai dirimu.

231
00:20:45,336 --> 00:20:46,534
Atau kau akan merusaknya.

232
00:20:46,570 --> 00:20:50,490
Haluan 350. Kedalaman 100. Menyelam.

233
00:20:53,780 --> 00:20:55,698
Menurutmu berapa lama lagi waktu mereka?

234
00:20:55,748 --> 00:20:57,748
Kedalaman 150 tercapai.

